OL,3,GNEWSAGlobal Microsoft outage affecting
OL,4,ANI schools, councils and other services
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools, councils and other
OL,7,Forganisations across Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fare among those impacted by a global
OL,9,FMicrosoft outage.
OL,11,FProblems with the software giant
OL,12,Fstarted on Thursday, with monitoring
OL,13,Fwebsite Downdetector seeing problems
OL,14,Freported in more than 70 countries.
OL,16,FMicrosoft said it is seeing "sustained
OL,17,Fimprovements" in service availability.
OL,18,FIn its latest update Microsoft warns
OL,19,Fthat some users may continue to
OL,20,Fstruggle to connect or their emails may
OL,21,Fbe delayed.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
