OL,3,GNEWSAGlobal Microsoft outage affecting
OL,4,ANI schools, councils and other services
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic bodies such as the Education
OL,7,FAuthority said on Friday: "Outlook is
OL,8,Fcurrently unavailable to NI schools and
OL,9,Fthe Education Authority. Emails cannot
OL,10,Fcurrently be sent or received."
